# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DemoMuseum is a CLIENT repository of the MUSA app-service.
# It holds content and configuration only -- never application code and never
# large binaries (those live in the client's object storage bucket).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS artifacts ---------------------------------------------------------
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# --- Build output ---------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/

# --- Scratch --------------------------------------------------------------
# Local dumps, pre-selections and dead ends.
scratch/

# --- Large media should live in the bucket, not here ----------------------
# A model or a print-resolution image committed once is carried by every
# clone forever. The builder resolves assets from storage.assetsBaseUrl.
*.glb
*.usd
*.usda
*.usdc
*.usdz
*.tif
*.tiff
*.psd

# --- Local editor / agent configuration -----------------------------------
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.zed/

# Local API state (musa-build serve) — never commit the write overlay
.musa/
